  "configuration_id": "config_005",
  "reason": "The strongest completed result is RNA-only multiprofile with avgpool and PCA, with validation accuracy 0.591 and F1 0.573, clearly better than single-profile PCA and transformer aggregation. The key remaining uncertainty is whether a learned RNA representation can improve on PCA in this already promising profile/aggregation setting. config_005 changes only the RNA encoder to scvi_n200 while keeping RNA-only, multiprofile, and avgpool fixed, so it isolates the representation effect. This is a focused exploitation of the best current direction with higher expected accuracy than image-only, and it will clarify whether future multimodal experiments should be built on PCA or a learned RNA embedding."
}

